  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-xl mt-20">
    <div class="gradient w-full h-0.5"></div>
    <h2 class="text-3xl mt-5">Why this matters internationally</h2>
    <p class="max-w-xl mt-4">
      DD2030 is part of a wider global conversation about broad listening,
      plurality, civic technology, and AI-assisted democratic processes. The
      work is experimental and practical: tools are open source, lessons are
      shared publicly, and many activities are documented week by week.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-4 flex gap-4 flex-wrap">
      <a href="/history/" hreflang="ja" class="btn btn-outline">
